Subject: [PATCH] crypto: require CBC provider for EIP93 fallback

Backport the native package dependency from OpenWrt #26863
(head a6f51b8ce24e12275bf578a98df4685c0fb2862e). Dependency only:
this does not select EIP93 on OpenWrt.
Source: https://github.com/openwrt/openwrt/pull/26863
Original PR author: dormancygrace; buildroot-layer adaptation by this project.

--- a/package/kernel/linux/modules/crypto.mk
+++ b/package/kernel/linux/modules/crypto.mk
@@ -554,6 +554,7 @@
   TITLE:=MTK EIP93 crypto module
   DEPENDS:=@(TARGET_ramips_mt7621||TARGET_airoha) \
 	+kmod-crypto-authenc \
+	+kmod-crypto-cbc \
 	+kmod-crypto-des \
 	+kmod-crypto-md5 \
 	+kmod-crypto-sha1 \
